{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262ALJDkDpON1795446210.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國網絡安全公司CrowdStrike，拼購同業Zscaler，是歷來最大宗的網絡安全交易。</p><p></p><p>CrowdStrike宣布，以股票交易方式收購Zscaler。每股Zscaler可獲1.135股CrowdStrike，估值相當於約439億美元。交易預計在2028年下半年完成，CrowdStrike將持有Zscaler約百分之84權益。</p><p></p><p>另外，CrowdStrike公布截至10月底止，第三季度業績虧轉盈。賺約2,485萬美元，去年同期則蝕2,677萬美元。經調整每股盈利34美仙，期內，收入增加兩成八，至15.8億美元。</p><p></p><p>集團上調全年度收入預測，由最多60.1億美元，上調至60.84億美元。全年經調整每股盈利1.28美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.494694+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:36.237561+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:13.396022+00:00","content_hash":"b02b9f3e3c5750dd010294c82155bae7117b1dee419835cae553f20348ea147a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.494694+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}